## Noncompete

Any purpose is a permitted purpose, except for providing any product or
service that competes with the licensor's product or service as described
on the Licensor's website (<https://sanc.mooocopy.com>), or any product or
service that is intended to provide the same or substantially similar
functionality.

## Competition

To compete with the licensor's product or service, you provide any product
or service that is intended to provide the same or substantially similar
functionality to the licensor's product or service, or that provides
sanctions screening or sanctions list matching functionality of any kind.

## New Products

You may begin using the software to compete with the licensor's product or
service only after the licensor stops providing the software's functionality
as a product or service.

## Discontinued Products

You may begin using the software to compete with a product or service that
the licensor or any of its affiliates has stopped providing, unless the
licensor includes a plain-text line beginning with `Licensor Line of
Business:` with the software that mentions that line of business. The licensor
may add that line to the software at any time.

## Sales of Business

If you use the software to compete with the licensor's product or service,
and you sell a business that uses the software to compete with the licensor's
product or service, the value of that business must include the value of
licenses to use the software that the business purchased or otherwise
received.

## Survival

The licenses and restrictions in these terms survive the end of your license
to use the software.

